### Shop Module HTTP Tests

@accessToken = {{accessToken}}
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@shopId = {{shopId}}


### Create Shop (Super Admin Only)

# @name CreateShop

POST {{baseUrl}}/shops HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "address": "123 Test Street",
  "description": "A test shop",
  "name": "New Shop",
  "phone": "+1234567890",
  "slug": "new-shop",
  "workingHours": {
    "friday": "09:00-18:00",
    "monday": "09:00-18:00",
    "thursday": "09:00-18:00",
    "tuesday": "09:00-18:00",
    "wednesday": "09:00-18:00"
  }
}

> {%
  client.global.set('shopId', response.body.data.id);
  client.log('Shop created with ID: ' + response.body.data.id);
%}


### Get Shop by Slug

GET {{baseUrl}}/shops/test-shop HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Get Shop by ID

GET {{baseUrl}}/shops/id/{{shopId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Update Shop (Owner or Super Admin)

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/shops/{{shopId}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "description": "Updated description",
  "name": "Updated Shop Name",
  "phone": "+0987654321"
}


### Update Shop Media URLs (Owner or Super Admin)

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/shops/{{shopId}}/media HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "bannerUrl": "https://example.com/banner.jpg",
  "logoUrl": "https://example.com/logo.png"
}
